## 5. TERMINAL & DIRECTORY EXECUTION RULES
- For any React, Vite, or npm commands, you MUST execute them from inside the `frontend/` directory (e.g., `cd frontend && npm run dev`).
- For any Python, FastAPI, uvicorn, or ML script commands, you MUST execute them from inside the `backend/` directory, ensuring the virtual environment is activated.